From: SBE1V1K build <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: 为树外 PHY 驱动发布 phy_package 辅助接口

6.18 把 struct phy_package_shared 收进 drivers/net/phy/phy_package.c
变成私有类型，join 类函数的声明也搬到了私有的 drivers/net/phy/phylib.h。
qca-nss-phy（qca8084 / qce1204 / qca81xx）是树外模块，include 不到这个
头，于是编译立刻丢掉了全部声明：

  error: implicit declaration of function 'devm_of_phy_package_join'
  error: invalid use of undefined type 'struct phy_package_shared'

本补丁把这些原型放回 include/linux/phy.h，并新增
phy_package_get_base_addr()——base_addr 是厂商代码仍在读、而 6.18 唯一
没给访问器的成员。原有辅助函数上游都已 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL 导出，新增访问器
同样导出；没有监听者时行为不变。

分类：必须 shim（厂商内核 ABI）；只加声明和一个只读访问器。
diff -ruN a/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0513-net-phy-publish-phy-package-helpers.patch b/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0513-net-phy-publish-phy-package-helpers.patch
--- a/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0513-net-phy-publish-phy-package-helpers.patch	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/patches-6.18/0513-net-phy-publish-phy-package-helpers.patch	2026-11-22 23:31:26.873253952 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,64 @@
+net: phy: publish PHY package helpers for out-of-tree PHY drivers
+
+Mainline 6.18 moved struct phy_package_shared into drivers/net/phy/
+phy_package.c as a private type and kept the package-join helper
+declarations in the private drivers/net/phy/phylib.h header.  PHY drivers
+built outside the kernel tree (the QSDK qca-nss-phy package drives
+qca8084, qce1204 and qca81xx this way) cannot include that header, so
+they lost every declaration at once:
+
+  error: implicit declaration of function 'devm_of_phy_package_join'
+  error: invalid use of undefined type 'struct phy_package_shared'
+
+Publish the prototypes those drivers use in include/linux/phy.h, and add
+phy_package_get_base_addr(): base_addr is the only member they still
+read and the only one 6.18 left without an accessor.  All of the helpers
+are already EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL()ed upstream; the new accessor is exported
+the same way.
+
+Classification: must-shim (vendor kernel ABI); declarations plus one
+read-only accessor next to the existing ones.
+--- a/include/linux/phy.h
++++ b/include/linux/phy.h
+@@ -1903,6 +1903,26 @@
+ int phy_restart_aneg(struct phy_device *phydev);
+ int phy_reset_after_clk_enable(struct phy_device *phydev);
+ 
++/*
++ * PHY package support, for PHY drivers built outside the kernel tree: 6.18
++ * keeps these declarations in the private drivers/net/phy/phylib.h header,
++ * which external modules cannot include.
++ */
++struct device_node;
++struct device_node *phy_package_get_node(struct phy_device *phydev);
++void *phy_package_get_priv(struct phy_device *phydev);
++int phy_package_get_base_addr(struct phy_device *phydev);
++int phy_package_join(struct phy_device *phydev, int base_addr, size_t priv_size);
++int of_phy_package_join(struct phy_device *phydev, size_t priv_size);
++void phy_package_leave(struct phy_device *phydev);
++int devm_phy_package_join(struct device *dev, struct phy_device *phydev,
++			  int base_addr, size_t priv_size);
++int devm_of_phy_package_join(struct device *dev, struct phy_device *phydev,
++			     size_t priv_size);
++bool phy_package_init_once(struct phy_device *phydev);
++bool phy_package_probe_once(struct phy_device *phydev);
++bool phy_package_remove_once(struct phy_device *phydev);
++
+ #if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PHYLIB)
+ int phy_start_cable_test(struct phy_device *phydev,
+ 			 struct netlink_ext_ack *extack);
+--- a/drivers/net/phy/phy_package.c
++++ b/drivers/net/phy/phy_package.c
+@@ -52,6 +52,12 @@
+ }
+ EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(phy_package_get_priv);
+ 
++int phy_package_get_base_addr(struct phy_device *phydev)
++{
++	return phydev->shared->base_addr;
++}
++EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(phy_package_get_base_addr);
++
+ static int phy_package_address(struct phy_device *phydev,
+ 			       unsigned int addr_offset)
+ {
